# Services and APIs

The application integrates with various services for data processing, AI, and storage.

## Service Categories

- `ai` - AI service integrations (Anthropic, OpenAI)
- `cloudflare` - Cloudflare service integrations
- `knowledge-layer` - Knowledge management services
- `mastra` - MASTRA service integration
- `processing` - Data processing services
- `r2r` - R2R service integration
- `ranking` - Ranking services
- `sightings` - Sightings data services

## Key Service Files

- [apps/app/src/services/ai](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/services/ai) - AI services
- [apps/app/src/services/processing](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/services/processing) - Data processing
- [apps/app/src/services/knowledge-layer](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/services/knowledge-layer) - Knowledge services
- [apps/app/src/services/sightings](mdc:ultraterrestrial-resurrection/apps/app/src/services/sightings) - Sightings services

## Libraries

- `anthropic` - Anthropic API integration
- `composio` - Composio integration
- `firecrawl` - Firecrawl integration
- `mem0` - Mem0 integration
- `openai` - OpenAI integration
- `tavily` - Tavily integration
- `upstash` - Upstash integration

## Database Integrations

- `db/supabase` - Supabase database integration
- `db/xata` - Xata database integration
